#: ../../source/integrations-guide/restful-api.rst:22
msgid "**User provisioning**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/restful-api.rst:24
msgid ""
"Write a script to automatically create and manage user accounts in "
"Mattermost, ensuring that new team members are added to the right teams "
"and channels as part of your onboarding process."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/restful-api.rst:26
msgid "**Channel management**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/restful-api.rst:28
msgid ""
"Use the API to programmatically create, archive, or update channels, "
"making it easy to align collaboration spaces with your project lifecycle "
"or organizational changes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/restful-api.rst:30
msgid "**Message automation**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/restful-api.rst:32
msgid ""
"Build a script or integration that posts messages or reminders into "
"specific channels on a schedule, such as daily stand-up prompts, release "
"announcements, or security notifications."
msgstr ""

